<title>USA: Barrett Resources sets $150 mln snr notes.</title>
<headline>Barrett Resources sets $150 mln snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Barrett Resources Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER BARRETT RESOURCES</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.55 PCT   MATURITY 2/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.732  FIRST PAY DATE 8/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA1   YIELD  7.588 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD +118 BPS   MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT T +25</p>
<p>						   BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
